  "title": "Hear Ford’s Le Mans Hypercar Crank to Life",
  "summary": "Ford’s plan to compete at the 24 Hours of Le Mans in 2027 just got a little closer. Ahead of the new race car’s on-track debut in “just a matter of weeks,” Ford has started up the 5.4-liter, naturally aspirated, Coyote-based V-8 in the chassis, with the accompanying spec hybrid system, for the first time. […]",
